  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the **Daily Tactical Challenge** feature, adding it as a primary game mode accessible from the main menu, top navigation bar, and matchmaker modal.\n\n### Key Additions & Functionality:\n\n- **24-Hour Automated Tactical Cycle**:\n  - Dynamically computes and rotates a master chess challenge every 24 hours at midnight.\n  - Features an active, real-time countdown clock (*\"Next Challenge In: HH:MM:SS\"*).\n  - Fetches live challenges online with seamless fallback to an extensive master archive.\n\n- **Main Menu & Header Integration**:\n  - Added **\"Daily Mission\"** directly to the primary top navigation tabs with an active `24h` badge and \342\230\200\357\270\217 crest.\n  - Added a dedicated **Daily Tactical Challenge** card to the **Start New Match** modal with today\'s puzzle title, difficulty rating, and quick-launch button.\n\n- **Tactical Assistant & Move Execution**:\n  - **Step-by-Step Solver**: Interactive chessboard with turn instructions, step progress dots, and tolerant SAN move matching.\n  - **Peshmerga Scout Hint**: Reveals key starting piece coordinates and strategic motifs without spoiling the solution.\n  - **Grandmaster Solution & Analysis**: Interactive breakdown showing the complete move combination and tactical reasoning.\n  - **Reset & Replay**: Instant position reset.\n\n- **Daily Streak & Archive Calendar**:\n  - Tracks consecutive daily solves with fire streak animations and total solved counters.\n  - Includes a full **Archive Calendar Drawer** allowing players to browse and replay challenges from previous days of the month.\n\n- **Peshmerga Respect & Elo Rewards**:\n  - Awards **+25 Respect Points** and **+15 Tactics Elo** upon completion, accompanied by canvas confetti and sound effects.\n  - **1-Click Share**: Formats results with streak metrics for sharing to the clipboard."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the **Daily Tactical Challenge** feature, adding it as a primary game mode accessible from the main menu, top navigation bar, and matchmaker modal.\n\n### Key Additions & Functionality:\n\n- **24-Hour Automated Tactical Cycle**:\n  - Dynamically computes and rotates a master chess challenge every 24 hours at midnight.\n  - Features an active, real-time countdown clock (*\"Next Challenge In: HH:MM:SS\"*).\n  - Fetches live challenges online with seamless fallback to an extensive master archive.\n\n- **Main Menu & Header Integration**:\n  - Added **\"Daily Mission\"** directly to the primary top navigation tabs with an active `24h` badge and \342\230\200\357\270\217 crest.\n  - Added a dedicated **Daily Tactical Challenge** card to the **Start New Match** modal with today\'s puzzle title, difficulty rating, and quick-launch button.\n\n- **Tactical Assistant & Move Execution**:\n  - **Step-by-Step Solver**: Interactive chessboard with turn instructions, step progress dots, and tolerant SAN move matching.\n  - **Peshmerga Scout Hint**: Reveals key starting piece coordinates and strategic motifs without spoiling the solution.\n  - **Grandmaster Solution & Analysis**: Interactive breakdown showing the complete move combination and tactical reasoning.\n  - **Reset & Replay**: Instant position reset.\n\n- **Daily Streak & Archive Calendar**:\n  - Tracks consecutive daily solves with fire streak animations and total solved counters.\n  - Includes a full **Archive Calendar Drawer** allowing players to browse and replay challenges from previous days of the month.\n\n- **Peshmerga Respect & Elo Rewards**:\n  - Awards **+25 Respect Points** and **+15 Tactics Elo** upon completion, accompanied by canvas confetti and sound effects.\n  - **1-Click Share**: Formats results with streak metrics for sharing to the clipboard."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
