  planner_response {
    response: "I have organized and restructured the top header into responsive panels designed to adapt to all screen sizes (mobile, tablet, laptop, and ultra-wide displays).\n\n### Key Improvements:\n\n- **Structured 3-Panel Organization**:\n  - **Panel 1: Brand & Citadel Identity (Left)**: Houses the 21-Ray Kurdish Sun emblem, \"Chesskys\" typography, Jamadani Crimson `PRO` badge, and live database connection status.\n  - **Panel 2: Tactical Navigation & Modes Center (Middle)**: A frosted-glass segmented controller organizing all core modes (**Play AI**, **Daily Mission [24h]**, **Tactics**, **Pass & Play**, **Analysis**, and **Worldwide Quick Match**).\n  - **Panel 3: Player Hub & Quick Actions (Right)**: Features the **Peshmerga Respect Honor Pill** (with instant leaderboard access), **Friends & Social Hub**, **Warrior Profile Avatar**, **New Match CTA**, and **Settings & Themes**.\n\n- **Screen-Adaptive Reactivity**:\n  - **Desktop & Ultra-wide (`lg` / `xl`)**: Spacious 3-panel single-row layout with full icons, typography labels, and tactical badges.\n  - **Tablet (`md` / `sm`)**: Balanced spacing with auto-condensing labels and high-priority action pills.\n  - **Mobile (`< lg`)**:\n    - **Top Bar**: Streamlines brand identity, respect counter, avatar, and quick menu toggle.\n    - **Touch Sub-Bar**: A smooth, touch-friendly horizontal mode bar with hidden scrollbars for one-tap switching between AI, Daily Challenge, Tactics, Pass & Play, Analysis, and Worldwide matchmaking.\n    - **Mobile Command Drawer**: A floating quick-action drawer providing one-tap access to New Match setup, Friends & Social, Leaderboards, Profile, and Themes."
