  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the **Puzzle Creator Studio (Authoring Tool)**, **Battle Logs & Match History Dashboard**, and the **Multiplayer Game Arena & Matchmaking System**:\n\n- **Creator Studio (Authoring Tool)**:\n  - **Custom Position & Move Authoring**: Set up any starting board position by editing standard FEN notation or loading presets (Classic Checkmates, Smothered Mates, Arabian Mates, Pin & Skewer tactics).\n  - **Move Sequence Recorder**: Interactive board move recording allowing authors to record the solution sequence, side to move, tactical theme tags, and difficulty rating.\n  - **Live Testing & Instant Publishing**: Integrated interactive \"Test Solve\" mode before publishing, with cloud sync to Firestore and local storage caching for offline support.\n\n- **Battle Logs & Match History (Logging View)**:\n  - **Combat Record & Audit Trail**: Comprehensive overview of matches played across AI, Pass & Play, Multiplayer, and Daily Puzzles.\n  - **Filterable Match Analytics**: Filter matches by result (Victories, Defeats, Draws, Executions), inspect moves count, ELO/Respect rating changes, and review final position boards.\n  - **PGN & JSON Import/Export**: One-click copy or download of match PGN logs and JSON audit records for deep post-game analysis.\n\n- **Multiplayer Game Arena & Worldwide Matchmaking**:\n  - **Instant 1-Click Queue**: Select time controls (Bullet, Blitz, Rapid, Classical) and instantly pair with online players or grandmasters.\n  - **Custom Room Generation**: Create challenge rooms with custom time controls and piece colors (White, Black, or Random), generating shareable room codes.\n  - **Open Public Arena & Join by Code**: Real-time lobby of active public challenges waiting for opponents with live matchmaking updates.\n\n- **Responsive Header & Navigation**:\n  - Direct access to Creator Studio, Battle Logs, and Multiplayer Arena across desktop tabs, tablet view, and mobile command drawers."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the **Puzzle Creator Studio (Authoring Tool)**, **Battle Logs & Match History Dashboard**, and the **Multiplayer Game Arena & Matchmaking System**:\n\n- **Creator Studio (Authoring Tool)**:\n  - **Custom Position & Move Authoring**: Set up any starting board position by editing standard FEN notation or loading presets (Classic Checkmates, Smothered Mates, Arabian Mates, Pin & Skewer tactics).\n  - **Move Sequence Recorder**: Interactive board move recording allowing authors to record the solution sequence, side to move, tactical theme tags, and difficulty rating.\n  - **Live Testing & Instant Publishing**: Integrated interactive \"Test Solve\" mode before publishing, with cloud sync to Firestore and local storage caching for offline support.\n\n- **Battle Logs & Match History (Logging View)**:\n  - **Combat Record & Audit Trail**: Comprehensive overview of matches played across AI, Pass & Play, Multiplayer, and Daily Puzzles.\n  - **Filterable Match Analytics**: Filter matches by result (Victories, Defeats, Draws, Executions), inspect moves count, ELO/Respect rating changes, and review final position boards.\n  - **PGN & JSON Import/Export**: One-click copy or download of match PGN logs and JSON audit records for deep post-game analysis.\n\n- **Multiplayer Game Arena & Worldwide Matchmaking**:\n  - **Instant 1-Click Queue**: Select time controls (Bullet, Blitz, Rapid, Classical) and instantly pair with online players or grandmasters.\n  - **Custom Room Generation**: Create challenge rooms with custom time controls and piece colors (White, Black, or Random), generating shareable room codes.\n  - **Open Public Arena & Join by Code**: Real-time lobby of active public challenges waiting for opponents with live matchmaking updates.\n\n- **Responsive Header & Navigation**:\n  - Direct access to Creator Studio, Battle Logs, and Multiplayer Arena across desktop tabs, tablet view, and mobile command drawers."
