  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the **Cloud Database Explorer & Database Management System** integrated directly into Chesskys PRO:\n\n- **Live Cloud Database Explorer**: Built a dedicated database management panel accessible via the primary navigation and developer controls to inspect, browse, search, and manage all Firestore collections in real time.\n- **Full Collection Coverage**: Direct access and operations across all core database collections:\n  - `users`: Player profiles, ELO rankings, respect points, and badge credentials.\n  - `online_matches`: Live multiplayer game sessions, FEN positions, and move clocks.\n  - `authored_puzzles`: Community-created tactical scenarios and solution steps.\n  - `game_logs`: Historical match audit records and PGN battle logs.\n  - `friend_requests`: Social invitations and player graph.\n  - `feedbacks`: User bug reports, engine feedback, and status resolutions.\n  - `announcements`: Broadcast notifications and championship updates.\n- **Interactive Document Operations**:\n  - **Live Latency & Health Check**: Real-time ping testing measuring response time to the active Firestore instance.\n  - **Create & Insert**: Pre-populated boilerplate payloads and custom JSON editor for writing new records to any collection.\n  - **Inline Editing & Schema Inspection**: Live JSON editor with schema validation before database commits.\n  - **One-Click Deletion & Safeguards**: Controlled removal with confirmation prompts.\n  - **Quick Seed & Backup Export**: Instant sample data population and one-click JSON collection export for backups.\n- **Security & Rules Deployment**: Deployed and hardened Firestore security rules to safeguard all collection endpoints and health checks."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the **Cloud Database Explorer & Database Management System** integrated directly into Chesskys PRO:\n\n- **Live Cloud Database Explorer**: Built a dedicated database management panel accessible via the primary navigation and developer controls to inspect, browse, search, and manage all Firestore collections in real time.\n- **Full Collection Coverage**: Direct access and operations across all core database collections:\n  - `users`: Player profiles, ELO rankings, respect points, and badge credentials.\n  - `online_matches`: Live multiplayer game sessions, FEN positions, and move clocks.\n  - `authored_puzzles`: Community-created tactical scenarios and solution steps.\n  - `game_logs`: Historical match audit records and PGN battle logs.\n  - `friend_requests`: Social invitations and player graph.\n  - `feedbacks`: User bug reports, engine feedback, and status resolutions.\n  - `announcements`: Broadcast notifications and championship updates.\n- **Interactive Document Operations**:\n  - **Live Latency & Health Check**: Real-time ping testing measuring response time to the active Firestore instance.\n  - **Create & Insert**: Pre-populated boilerplate payloads and custom JSON editor for writing new records to any collection.\n  - **Inline Editing & Schema Inspection**: Live JSON editor with schema validation before database commits.\n  - **One-Click Deletion & Safeguards**: Controlled removal with confirmation prompts.\n  - **Quick Seed & Backup Export**: Instant sample data population and one-click JSON collection export for backups.\n- **Security & Rules Deployment**: Deployed and hardened Firestore security rules to safeguard all collection endpoints and health checks."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
