  planner_response {
    response: "I have redesigned and organized the user interface, streamlined the main navigation, and consolidated the secondary and management panels into a divided **Settings & Studio Hub**:\n\n- **Streamlined Top Header Navigation**:\n  - **Clean Primary Mode Bar**: Replaced overcrowded mode buttons with 4 core gameplay modes:\n    - \360\237\244\226 **Play AI**: Single-player battle against AI personalities with dynamic Elo scaling.\n    - \342\232\224\357\270\217 **Multiplayer**: Online room matchmaking and custom lobby pairings.\n    - \360\237\247\251 **Puzzles & Daily**: Unified hub combining the 24-hour Daily Tactical Mission and the Grandmaster Tactics Library.\n    - \360\237\224\215 **Analysis**: Interactive analysis board with PGN/FEN exploration and Stockfish evaluation.\n  - **Quick Match Action**: Prominent worldwide matchmaking button with live status ping.\n  - **Unified Action Hub**: Social friends list, Peshmerga Respect leaderboard, profile credentials, and quick access to the new Settings & Studio Hub.\n\n- **Divided Settings & Studio Hub**:\n  - **Categorized Sections**: Organized all secondary tools and settings into divided tabs:\n    - \360\237\216\250 **UI Themes**: Curated Kurdish military and high-contrast grandmaster palettes, plus the Custom Theme Creator.\n    - \342\231\237\357\270\217 **Piece & Board Sets**: 7 vector piece sets (Peshmerga Royal, UKH Chancellor, Crystal Neon, FIDE 3D, Classic Staunton, etc.) and 8 chessboard color finishes.\n    - \342\232\231\357\270\217 **Gameplay Controls**: Move audio sound effects, legal move highlight dots, evaluation bar gauge, board coordinates, and last-move indicators.\n    - \360\237\227\204\357\270\217 **Cloud Database Explorer**: Live Firestore database inspector to browse, search, edit, seed, and backup collections (`users`, `online_matches`, `authored_puzzles`, `game_logs`, etc.).\n    - \360\237\223\234 **Battle Logs**: Match audit records, PGN game viewers, and export tools.\n    - \360\237\247\251 **Creator Studio**: Custom puzzle authoring board, FEN position builder, and community puzzle sharing.\n    - \360\237\221\221 **Developer Settings**: Role management, badge assignments, respect points editor, and instant account switcher.\n    - \360\237\222\254 **Feedback & Support**: Direct feedback submission modal for players.\n\n- **Polished Board Stage & Mobile Experience**:\n  - Clean layout margins and responsive padding across desktop and mobile screens.\n  - Compact, high-contrast digital clocks, captured piece advantage counters, and streamlined move history table."
    modified_response: "I have redesigned and organized the user interface, streamlined the main navigation, and consolidated the secondary and management panels into a divided **Settings & Studio Hub**:\n\n- **Streamlined Top Header Navigation**:\n  - **Clean Primary Mode Bar**: Replaced overcrowded mode buttons with 4 core gameplay modes:\n    - \360\237\244\226 **Play AI**: Single-player battle against AI personalities with dynamic Elo scaling.\n    - \342\232\224\357\270\217 **Multiplayer**: Online room matchmaking and custom lobby pairings.\n    - \360\237\247\251 **Puzzles & Daily**: Unified hub combining the 24-hour Daily Tactical Mission and the Grandmaster Tactics Library.\n    - \360\237\224\215 **Analysis**: Interactive analysis board with PGN/FEN exploration and Stockfish evaluation.\n  - **Quick Match Action**: Prominent worldwide matchmaking button with live status ping.\n  - **Unified Action Hub**: Social friends list, Peshmerga Respect leaderboard, profile credentials, and quick access to the new Settings & Studio Hub.\n\n- **Divided Settings & Studio Hub**:\n  - **Categorized Sections**: Organized all secondary tools and settings into divided tabs:\n    - \360\237\216\250 **UI Themes**: Curated Kurdish military and high-contrast grandmaster palettes, plus the Custom Theme Creator.\n    - \342\231\237\357\270\217 **Piece & Board Sets**: 7 vector piece sets (Peshmerga Royal, UKH Chancellor, Crystal Neon, FIDE 3D, Classic Staunton, etc.) and 8 chessboard color finishes.\n    - \342\232\231\357\270\217 **Gameplay Controls**: Move audio sound effects, legal move highlight dots, evaluation bar gauge, board coordinates, and last-move indicators.\n    - \360\237\227\204\357\270\217 **Cloud Database Explorer**: Live Firestore database inspector to browse, search, edit, seed, and backup collections (`users`, `online_matches`, `authored_puzzles`, `game_logs`, etc.).\n    - \360\237\223\234 **Battle Logs**: Match audit records, PGN game viewers, and export tools.\n    - \360\237\247\251 **Creator Studio**: Custom puzzle authoring board, FEN position builder, and community puzzle sharing.\n    - \360\237\221\221 **Developer Settings**: Role management, badge assignments, respect points editor, and instant account switcher.\n    - \360\237\222\254 **Feedback & Support**: Direct feedback submission modal for players.\n\n- **Polished Board Stage & Mobile Experience**:\n  - Clean layout margins and responsive padding across desktop and mobile screens.\n  - Compact, high-contrast digital clocks, captured piece advantage counters, and streamlined move history table."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
