    response: "I have implemented full profile picture persistence and cloud synchronization across the entire application:\n\n- **Database & Cloud Synchronization**: Updating or changing your profile picture now immediately persists the image to Firestore (`users/{uid}` document with `photoURL`), synchronizes with Firebase Auth, and updates the local storage cache (`chess_user_avatar_[uid]`) for instant zero-latency rendering upon login and page refreshes.\n- **Direct Image Upload & Compression**: Added device file upload support with automatic client-side compression and square resizing to ensure lightweight database storage.\n- **Custom URL & Curated Kurdish Presets**: Added image link input alongside a curated library of Kurdish emblems and Peshmerga commander avatars with one-click equip and save.\n- **Imagen AI Avatar Studio Integration**: Equipping generated canvas avatars or archetype portraits directly saves the image to your account with visual confirmation."
