steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1788105012
      nanos: 382648176
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "add [Act as a Senior UI/UX Designer and Full-Stack Web Developer. \n\nI am building a web-based chess application. I need you to design and implement the Login Page and the User Profile Page based on the following functional and design requirements:\n\n---\n### 1. LOGIN PAGE REQUIREMENTS\n- **Header**: App logo (\"\342\231\237\357\270\217 ChessApp\") and a subtle chess-themed slogan.\n- **Authentication Methods**:\n  - Google and Apple Social Logins (OAuth buttons).\n  - Standard Email & Password form (with a \"Show/Hide Password\" toggle icon).\n  - \"Forgot Password?\" link.\n  - \"Remember Me\" checkbox for persistent sessions.\n- **Guest Access**: Prominent \"Play as Guest\" button allowing instant access to casual games without registration.\n- **Layout & Visuals**: Clean, modern dark-mode aesthetic with subtle chess board geometric patterns in the background.\n\n---\n### 2. USER PROFILE PAGE REQUIREMENTS\n- **Profile Header**:\n  - User Avatar (with custom uploaded image or default chess piece icon).\n  - Username, Display Name, Country Flag icon, and Online Status badge (Online / In-Game / Offline).\n  - Primary Action Buttons: \"Challenge to Game\" and \"Add Friend\".\n- **Ratings Card (Time Controls)**:\n  - Display Elo ratings for: Bullet (1-2m), Blitz (3-5m), Rapid (10-15m), Daily, and Puzzles.\n  - Show Current Rating, Peak Rating, and Total Games Played for each mode.\n- **Interactive Rating Progress Chart**:\n  - A clean line graph showing Elo rating over time with filters for [1W, 1M, 1Y, ALL].\n- **Recent Match History List**:\n  - Show the last 10 games with:\n    - Result badge (Green \"WIN\", Red \"LOSS\", Grey \"DRAW\").\n    - Opponent\342\200\231s avatar, username, and rating.\n    - Rating change (e.g., +8, -7).\n    - Game accuracy percentage (e.g., 84% accuracy).\n    - \"Analyze Game\" / \"Replay\" action button.\n- **Player Stats & Badges**:\n  - Win/Loss/Draw breakdown by piece color (White vs. Black).\n  - Achievement Badges section (e.g., \"First Tournament Win\", \"100 Puzzles Solved\").\n\n---\n### OUTPUT FORMAT NEEDED:\n1. Provide the complete component architecture and state management setup.\n2. Generate clean, responsive, modern code (e.g., React + Tailwind CSS / HTML + CSS) for both pages.\n3. Use a sleek Dark Mode theme (Slate/Zinc dark palette with emerald accents for wins and rose accents for losses).\n]"
    items {
      text: "add [Act as a Senior UI/UX Designer and Full-Stack Web Developer. \n\nI am building a web-based chess application. I need you to design and implement the Login Page and the User Profile Page based on the following functional and design requirements:\n\n---\n### 1. LOGIN PAGE REQUIREMENTS\n- **Header**: App logo (\"\342\231\237\357\270\217 ChessApp\") and a subtle chess-themed slogan.\n- **Authentication Methods**:\n  - Google and Apple Social Logins (OAuth buttons).\n  - Standard Email & Password form (with a \"Show/Hide Password\" toggle icon).\n  - \"Forgot Password?\" link.\n  - \"Remember Me\" checkbox for persistent sessions.\n- **Guest Access**: Prominent \"Play as Guest\" button allowing instant access to casual games without registration.\n- **Layout & Visuals**: Clean, modern dark-mode aesthetic with subtle chess board geometric patterns in the background.\n\n---\n### 2. USER PROFILE PAGE REQUIREMENTS\n- **Profile Header**:\n  - User Avatar (with custom uploaded image or default chess piece icon).\n  - Username, Display Name, Country Flag icon, and Online Status badge (Online / In-Game / Offline).\n  - Primary Action Buttons: \"Challenge to Game\" and \"Add Friend\".\n- **Ratings Card (Time Controls)**:\n  - Display Elo ratings for: Bullet (1-2m), Blitz (3-5m), Rapid (10-15m), Daily, and Puzzles.\n  - Show Current Rating, Peak Rating, and Total Games Played for each mode.\n- **Interactive Rating Progress Chart**:\n  - A clean line graph showing Elo rating over time with filters for [1W, 1M, 1Y, ALL].\n- **Recent Match History List**:\n  - Show the last 10 games with:\n    - Result badge (Green \"WIN\", Red \"LOSS\", Grey \"DRAW\").\n    - Opponent\342\200\231s avatar, username, and rating.\n    - Rating change (e.g., +8, -7).\n    - Game accuracy percentage (e.g., 84% accuracy).\n    - \"Analyze Game\" / \"Replay\" action button.\n- **Player Stats & Badges**:\n  - Win/Loss/Draw breakdown by piece color (White vs. Black).\n  - Achievement Badges section (e.g., \"First Tournament Win\", \"100 Puzzles Solved\").\n\n---\n### OUTPUT FORMAT NEEDED:\n1. Provide the complete component architecture and state management setup.\n2. Generate clean, responsive, modern code (e.g., React + Tailwind CSS / HTML + CSS) for both pages.\n3. Use a sleek Dark Mode theme (Slate/Zinc dark palette with emerald accents for wins and rose accents for losses).\n]"
    }
  }
}
