  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Constructing Login Components**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `/src/components/LoginPage.tsx` and `/src/components/UserProfilePage.tsx` components. Specifically, I\'m checking the details for the login page, starting with the header. The header should feature the app logo: \"\342\231\237\357\270\217 ChessApp\".\n\n\n**Defining Login Details**\n\nI\'ve been refining the login flow and authentication methods. I\'m prioritizing OAuth options using clean Google and Apple vector logos. Standard email/password login includes a \"Show/Hide Password\" toggle and a \"Forgot Password?\" link with an interactive recovery dialogue. The plan also considers a \"Remember Me\" checkbox for session persistence and a direct \"Play as Guest\" button for immediate casual gameplay. Finally, it\'s all styled with a dark, chess-inspired aesthetic.\n\n\n**Designing User Profile Details**\n\nI\'m now detailing the user profile interface. I want to include an avatar with a customizable country flag and online status. I\'m building out interactive action buttons for \"Challenge to Game\" and \"Add Friend\". Then, I\'m working on the rating display with Elo breakdowns for different time controls and an interactive progress chart. Finally, I\'m designing a recent match history list to show game results, opponents, and ratings.\n\n\n"
