  planner_response {
    response: "I have designed and implemented both the **Login Page** and the **User Profile Page** in a modern dark-mode aesthetic with Slate/Zinc palettes, emerald victory accents, and rose defeat markers:\n\n---\n\n### 1. \342\231\237\357\270\217 Login Page (`/src/components/LoginPage.tsx`)\n- **Header & Visual Identity**: Features the **\342\231\237\357\270\217 ChessApp** logo emblem with Kurdish sun badges and the slogan: *\"Master the 64 squares. Forge your legacy with precision and honor.\"*\n- **Dark Mode & Background Patterns**: Styled with a dark Slate/Zinc palette (`#090d14`), subtle geometric chessboard tiles, and soft radial atmospheric glows.\n- **Social OAuth Logins**: High-contrast Google and Apple ID authentication buttons with authentic vector icons.\n- **Standard Email & Password Form**:\n  - Sign In vs. Create Account mode toggle tabs.\n  - Password field with a **Show / Hide Password** toggle icon (`Eye` / `EyeOff`).\n  - **Remember Me** checkbox for persisting user credentials across sessions.\n  - **Forgot Password?** flow with automatic password reset dispatch.\n- **Instant Guest Access**: High-contrast **\342\232\241 Play as Guest** button allowing casual matches immediately without registration.\n- **Developer & Master Access**: Secure passkey drawer for quick testing and founder privilege unlocking.\n\n---\n\n### 2. \360\237\233\241\357\270\217 User Profile Page (`/src/components/UserProfilePage.tsx`)\n- **Profile Header**:\n  - Avatar image with direct AI Studio / custom image upload launcher.\n  - Display Name, unique `@username`, national flag (`\342\230\200\357\270\217 Kurdistan`), and customizable **Online Status Pill** (\360\237\237\242 *Online*, \342\232\224\357\270\217 *In-Game*, \342\232\252 *Offline*).\n  - Primary Action Buttons: **\342\232\224\357\270\217 Challenge to Game** and **\360\237\221\245 Add Friend** with real-time status transitions (*Add Friend* \342\206\222 *Request Sent* \342\206\222 *Friends \342\234\223*).\n- **Ratings Card (Time Controls Grid)**:\n  - 5-Card metrics grid displaying Current Elo, Peak Elo, and Games Played for:\n    - \342\232\241 **Bullet** (1-2m)\n    - \360\237\224\245 **Blitz** (3-5m)\n    - \342\217\261\357\270\217 **Rapid** (10-15m)\n    - \342\230\200\357\270\217 **Daily Correspondence**\n    - \360\237\247\251 **Puzzles Tactics**\n- **Interactive Rating Progress Chart**:\n  - Clean SVG line chart with fluid cubic-bezier curves and emerald-to-gold gradient fills.\n  - Time range filter tabs: `[1W, 1M, 1Y, ALL]`.\n  - Interactive hover state displaying full date, exact Elo rating, rating change (`+14` / `-11`), and opponent details.\n- **Recent Match History List (Last 10 Games)**:\n  - Color-coded result badges: Emerald **WIN**, Rose **LOSS**, and Slate **DRAW**.\n  - Opponent avatar, username, title, and rating.\n  - Elo delta rating indicators and game engine accuracy telemetry (e.g., `94.2% acc`).\n  - **\342\231\237\357\270\217 Analyze Game** action button that directly loads the game position and PGN into the live engine analysis board.\n- **Player Stats & Badges**:\n  - **Color Breakdown**: Segmented win/draw/loss progress bars for White (\342\231\224 64% Win Rate) vs. Black (\342\231\232 56% Win Rate).\n  - **Achievement Badges**: Grid of unlocked trophies including *First Tournament Win*, *100 Puzzles Solved*, *Citadel Grandmaster*, *Lightning Tactician*, *Peshmerga Sun of Glory*, and *95%+ Accuracy Master*."
