  user_input {
    user_response: "The profile/dashboard layout has a messy header panel and broken mobile responsiveness (panels get cut off / invisible on mobile).\n\nPlease refactor the UI with the following mobile-first optimizations:\n\n1. HEADER REDESIGN:\n   - Mobile (< 768px): Collapse the header into a sleek 56px sticky bar showing ONLY Avatar, Display Name, Country Flag, and Primary Rating. Hide secondary buttons/stats inside an expandable profile drawer or tab.\n   - Desktop (>= 768px): Show full header card with action buttons and multi-rating badges.\n\n2. MOBILE PANEL VISIBILITY & RESPONSIVENESS:\n   - Ensure the body area uses `overflow-y: auto` so all panels scroll smoothly on mobile.\n   - Implement horizontal swipeable tabs or a fixed bottom navigation bar for mobile panel switching (\"Overview\", \"Games\", \"Stats\").\n   - Set container height to `100dvh` (dynamic viewport height) to prevent mobile browser address bar clipping.\n\n3. UI SCALING & TOUCH TARGETS:\n   - Increase touch targets for all buttons and tabs to minimum 44x44px.\n   - Set minimum base font size to 14px for readability on small screens.\n   - Add proper padding (`px-4 py-3`) between cards so content doesn\'t touch screen edges."
    items {
      text: "The profile/dashboard layout has a messy header panel and broken mobile responsiveness (panels get cut off / invisible on mobile).\n\nPlease refactor the UI with the following mobile-first optimizations:\n\n1. HEADER REDESIGN:\n   - Mobile (< 768px): Collapse the header into a sleek 56px sticky bar showing ONLY Avatar, Display Name, Country Flag, and Primary Rating. Hide secondary buttons/stats inside an expandable profile drawer or tab.\n   - Desktop (>= 768px): Show full header card with action buttons and multi-rating badges.\n\n2. MOBILE PANEL VISIBILITY & RESPONSIVENESS:\n   - Ensure the body area uses `overflow-y: auto` so all panels scroll smoothly on mobile.\n   - Implement horizontal swipeable tabs or a fixed bottom navigation bar for mobile panel switching (\"Overview\", \"Games\", \"Stats\").\n   - Set container height to `100dvh` (dynamic viewport height) to prevent mobile browser address bar clipping.\n\n3. UI SCALING & TOUCH TARGETS:\n   - Increase touch targets for all buttons and tabs to minimum 44x44px.\n   - Set minimum base font size to 14px for readability on small screens.\n   - Add proper padding (`px-4 py-3`) between cards so content doesn\'t touch screen edges."
    }
  }
}
