  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented subtle, rewarding CSS-based entry and status update animations for the **Respect** honor badge and points display across the profile header and navigation:\n\n- **Spring Entry & Shimmer (`.respect-badge-entry` & `.respect-shimmer-sheen`)**: Applied a cubic-bezier spring entry animation (`scale` from $0.90 \\rightarrow 1.04 \\rightarrow 1.0$) paired with a subtle, continuous gold gradient shimmer sweep across the badge background.\n- **Rewarding Point Bump (`.respect-points-bump`)**: Configured a keyframe text and scale pop with a golden bloom whenever the respect points increase or update, providing clear visual satisfaction.\n- **Ambient Radial Bloom (`.respect-bloom-active`)**: Added an expanding golden ring pulse around the badge upon point updates.\n- **Delta Indicator (`.respect-delta-pill`)**: Integrated a floating `+X pts` delta indicator that floats upward and gently dissolves when points are awarded.\n- **Consistent Visual Integration**: Embedded the animated `RespectHonorBadge` in the desktop profile hero card, the sub-navigation tab bar, the mobile profile drawer, and the top global navigation header."
    modified_response: "I have implemented subtle, rewarding CSS-based entry and status update animations for the **Respect** honor badge and points display across the profile header and navigation:\n\n- **Spring Entry & Shimmer (`.respect-badge-entry` & `.respect-shimmer-sheen`)**: Applied a cubic-bezier spring entry animation (`scale` from $0.90 \\rightarrow 1.04 \\rightarrow 1.0$) paired with a subtle, continuous gold gradient shimmer sweep across the badge background.\n- **Rewarding Point Bump (`.respect-points-bump`)**: Configured a keyframe text and scale pop with a golden bloom whenever the respect points increase or update, providing clear visual satisfaction.\n- **Ambient Radial Bloom (`.respect-bloom-active`)**: Added an expanding golden ring pulse around the badge upon point updates.\n- **Delta Indicator (`.respect-delta-pill`)**: Integrated a floating `+X pts` delta indicator that floats upward and gently dissolves when points are awarded.\n- **Consistent Visual Integration**: Embedded the animated `RespectHonorBadge` in the desktop profile hero card, the sub-navigation tab bar, the mobile profile drawer, and the top global navigation header."
