  user_input {
    user_response: "Build a custom theme engine for a web chess game inspired by Attack on Titan.\n\n1. BOARD THEME:\n   - Apply dark fantasy styling with Wall Maria stone textures.\n   - Dark Squares: #1f232b (Weathered dark stone).\n   - Light Squares: #5d6f54 (Survey Corps green tint).\n   - Highlight active piece moves with a green ODM gas glow aura (rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4)).\n   - Highlight Check/Danger with a red steam animation (#ef4444).\n\n2. CUSTOM PIECE SVG / ICON MAPPING:\n   - White (Scout Regiment):\n     - King: Erwin/Eren Crown with crossed ODM blades.\n     - Queen: Mikasa scarf symbol + dual swords.\n     - Bishops: Levi/Hange emblem.\n     - Knights: Scout Horse / ODM Gear icon.\n     - Rooks: Wall Maria Fortress tower.\n     - Pawns: Wings of Freedom shield badge.\n   - Black (Titans):\n     - King: Colossal Titan head outline with steam aura.\n     - Queen: Female Titan hardened crystal icon.\n     - Bishops: Beast Titan / Jaw Titan jawbones.\n     - Knights: Cart Titan / Sprinting Titan silhouette.\n     - Rooks: Armored Titan hardened plate armor.\n     - Pawns: Pure Titan silhouette.\n\n3. UI OVERLAY:\n   - Player 1 Profile Card (Bottom): Scout Regiment badge with emerald accents.\n   - Player 2 Profile Card (Top): Marleyan/Titan badge with crimson accents."
    items {
      text: "Build a custom theme engine for a web chess game inspired by Attack on Titan.\n\n1. BOARD THEME:\n   - Apply dark fantasy styling with Wall Maria stone textures.\n   - Dark Squares: #1f232b (Weathered dark stone).\n   - Light Squares: #5d6f54 (Survey Corps green tint).\n   - Highlight active piece moves with a green ODM gas glow aura (rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4)).\n   - Highlight Check/Danger with a red steam animation (#ef4444).\n\n2. CUSTOM PIECE SVG / ICON MAPPING:\n   - White (Scout Regiment):\n     - King: Erwin/Eren Crown with crossed ODM blades.\n     - Queen: Mikasa scarf symbol + dual swords.\n     - Bishops: Levi/Hange emblem.\n     - Knights: Scout Horse / ODM Gear icon.\n     - Rooks: Wall Maria Fortress tower.\n     - Pawns: Wings of Freedom shield badge.\n   - Black (Titans):\n     - King: Colossal Titan head outline with steam aura.\n     - Queen: Female Titan hardened crystal icon.\n     - Bishops: Beast Titan / Jaw Titan jawbones.\n     - Knights: Cart Titan / Sprinting Titan silhouette.\n     - Rooks: Armored Titan hardened plate armor.\n     - Pawns: Pure Titan silhouette.\n\n3. UI OVERLAY:\n   - Player 1 Profile Card (Bottom): Scout Regiment badge with emerald accents.\n   - Player 2 Profile Card (Top): Marleyan/Titan badge with crimson accents."
    }
  }
}
