  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Defining AOT Theme Colors**\n\nRight now, I\'m meticulously crafting the SVG definitions specifically for the \'aot\' theme. I\'m focusing intently on the color scheme for the \"White\" or Scouts group. I\'ve pinned down the Survey Corps emerald green, with several shades in mind, and the iconic Wings of Freedom blue is next on my list to finalize.\n\n\n**Defining More AOT Elements**\n\nI\'ve been busy establishing the color palette for the \"Black\" or Titan faction, nailing down shades for Colossal Titan steam, flesh, and hardening crystal. I\'ve also specified the golden and bone-colored armored plates and glowing eye colors. I\'m now transitioning to coding the SVG elements, starting with the white pawn and knight pieces. The pawn will feature the Wings of Freedom shield with specific blue and white wing details. The knight will be the Survey Corps steed with ODM gear.\n\n\n**Constructing AOT Chess Pieces**\n\nI\'m now deep into designing the AOT-themed chess pieces, going through the visual details meticulously. I\'ve detailed the White pieces, now moving to the Black side. I\'m focusing on the pawn\'s ominous Titan silhouette, and defining the bishop as Levi and Hange, featuring special ops blades, and cravat/monocle details. The rook will be Wall Maria, and the queen will be Mikasa with a scarf and swords, and I\'m finalizing the king as a combination of Erwin and Eren\'s crown and blades.\n\n\n**Visualizing Titan Piece Figures**\n\nI\'m now zeroing in on the \"Black\" side chess pieces\' appearance. I\'ve got a chilling visual in mind for the pawn: a wide Titan grin, bared teeth, and rising neck steam. Next, the knight will be the Cart Titan, specifically its sprinting silhouette with metallic facial armor. The bishop is becoming the Beast Titan, visualized with armored jawbones and crimson eyes. The rook will be the Armored Titan\'s plate armor. Then I visualize the queen as the Female Titan, encased in a glowing crystal. And finally, the king will be a Colossal Titan head outline wreathed in steam.\n\n\n"
