  planner_response {
    response: "I have implemented the custom **Attack on Titan: Battle for Wall Maria** theme engine for the chess platform:\n\n- **Wall Maria Board Theme**:\n  - **Color Palette & Masonry**: Applied weathered dark stone (`#1f232b`) for dark squares and Survey Corps green tint (`#5d6f54`) for light squares with custom stone brick textures.\n  - **ODM Gas Move Glow**: Enhanced selected squares and legal move indicators with an emerald omni-directional mobility gas aura (`rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4)`).\n  - **Colossal Steam Danger**: Implemented a billowing thermal red steam animation (`#ef4444`) with rising vapor particles whenever the King is in check.\n  - **Wall Maria Watermark**: Added a subtle stone battlement and crossed ODM slasher blades watermark centered on the board.\n\n- **Custom Vector Piece Set**:\n  - **White (Scout Regiment / Survey Corps)**:\n    - **King**: Commander Erwin\'s golden triple crown flanked by crossed ultrahard steel ODM blades and wire coils.\n    - **Queen**: Mikasa\'s signature crimson wrapped scarf draped across dual vertical slasher blades with emerald brooch.\n    - **Bishops**: Special Operations Squad reverse-grip blades with Hange\'s tactical monocle crest.\n    - **Knights**: Armored Survey Corps battle steed equipped with dual ODM gas canisters and grapple nozzles.\n    - **Rooks**: 50-meter Wall Maria monolithic fortress tower with fortified stone battlements and cannon embrasures.\n    - **Pawns**: The iconic Wings of Freedom shield badge with overlapping blue and white feathered wings.\n  - **Black (The Nine Titans / Marley Forces)**:\n    - **King**: Colossal Titan skinless muscle sinew skull crowned with rising thermal steam plumes.\n    - **Queen**: Female Titan silhouette encrusted in multifaceted glowing blue-white hardening crystals.\n    - **Bishops**: Beast Titan fur silhouette framed by the reinforced razor-toothed jawbone of the Jaw Titan.\n    - **Knights**: Cart Titan quadrupedal profile with mechanical facial armor mask and artillery harness.\n    - **Rooks**: Armored Titan heavy interlocking golden-bronze armor plates with thermal exhaust slits.\n    - **Pawns**: Menacing Pure Titan silhouette with wide bared grin and glowing amber eyes.\n\n- **Themed UI Profile Overlay**:\n  - **Player 1 Profile Card (Bottom)**: Emerald-accented Scout Regiment badge with live pulse indicator.\n  - **Player 2 Profile Card (Top)**: Crimson-accented Marleyan Titan Force badge with flame crest.\n  - **Settings & Studio Hub**: Integrated into the preset theme selector to synchronize board, piece, and UI palettes with a single click."
    modified_response: "I have implemented the custom **Attack on Titan: Battle for Wall Maria** theme engine for the chess platform:\n\n- **Wall Maria Board Theme**:\n  - **Color Palette & Masonry**: Applied weathered dark stone (`#1f232b`) for dark squares and Survey Corps green tint (`#5d6f54`) for light squares with custom stone brick textures.\n  - **ODM Gas Move Glow**: Enhanced selected squares and legal move indicators with an emerald omni-directional mobility gas aura (`rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.4)`).\n  - **Colossal Steam Danger**: Implemented a billowing thermal red steam animation (`#ef4444`) with rising vapor particles whenever the King is in check.\n  - **Wall Maria Watermark**: Added a subtle stone battlement and crossed ODM slasher blades watermark centered on the board.\n\n- **Custom Vector Piece Set**:\n  - **White (Scout Regiment / Survey Corps)**:\n    - **King**: Commander Erwin\'s golden triple crown flanked by crossed ultrahard steel ODM blades and wire coils.\n    - **Queen**: Mikasa\'s signature crimson wrapped scarf draped across dual vertical slasher blades with emerald brooch.\n    - **Bishops**: Special Operations Squad reverse-grip blades with Hange\'s tactical monocle crest.\n    - **Knights**: Armored Survey Corps battle steed equipped with dual ODM gas canisters and grapple nozzles.\n    - **Rooks**: 50-meter Wall Maria monolithic fortress tower with fortified stone battlements and cannon embrasures.\n    - **Pawns**: The iconic Wings of Freedom shield badge with overlapping blue and white feathered wings.\n  - **Black (The Nine Titans / Marley Forces)**:\n    - **King**: Colossal Titan skinless muscle sinew skull crowned with rising thermal steam plumes.\n    - **Queen**: Female Titan silhouette encrusted in multifaceted glowing blue-white hardening crystals.\n    - **Bishops**: Beast Titan fur silhouette framed by the reinforced razor-toothed jawbone of the Jaw Titan.\n    - **Knights**: Cart Titan quadrupedal profile with mechanical facial armor mask and artillery harness.\n    - **Rooks**: Armored Titan heavy interlocking golden-bronze armor plates with thermal exhaust slits.\n    - **Pawns**: Menacing Pure Titan silhouette with wide bared grin and glowing amber eyes.\n\n- **Themed UI Profile Overlay**:\n  - **Player 1 Profile Card (Bottom)**: Emerald-accented Scout Regiment badge with live pulse indicator.\n  - **Player 2 Profile Card (Top)**: Crimson-accented Marleyan Titan Force badge with flame crest.\n  - **Settings & Studio Hub**: Integrated into the preset theme selector to synchronize board, piece, and UI palettes with a single click."
