  planner_response {
    response: "**Yes, the login page is fully functional!**\n\nHere is an overview of how authentication and user profiles work in the application:\n\n### 1. Available Authentication Methods\n- **Google Sign-In**: Instant one-click authentication with Google Auth popup.\n- **Email & Password**: Full Sign In and Account Registration flows with error handling (e.g. invalid password, existing account, password requirements).\n- **Guest / Demo Mode**: Instant access with a temporary guest profile for immediate gameplay.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Connected Features Upon Login\nOnce signed in, the system automatically binds and synchronizes your account across all features:\n- **Cloud Profile & Ratings**: Tracks your ELO rating, Respect & Honor points, and level progression in Firestore.\n- **Match History & Database**: Saves completed matches, game outcomes, and move notations to your profile.\n- **Multiplayer & Matchmaking**: Displays your custom username, avatar, and rating in Worldwide matches and Friend challenges.\n- **Friends & Live Chat**: Enables adding friends, checking online status, and private messaging.\n\n---\n\n### 3. How to Access the Login Page\n- Click the **\"Sign In\"** button in the top right corner of the header, or\n- Select the **\"Account\" / \"Profile\"** option in the navigation bar to sign in or review your stats."
    modified_response: "**Yes, the login page is fully functional!**\n\nHere is an overview of how authentication and user profiles work in the application:\n\n### 1. Available Authentication Methods\n- **Google Sign-In**: Instant one-click authentication with Google Auth popup.\n- **Email & Password**: Full Sign In and Account Registration flows with error handling (e.g. invalid password, existing account, password requirements).\n- **Guest / Demo Mode**: Instant access with a temporary guest profile for immediate gameplay.\n\n---\n\n### 2. Connected Features Upon Login\nOnce signed in, the system automatically binds and synchronizes your account across all features:\n- **Cloud Profile & Ratings**: Tracks your ELO rating, Respect & Honor points, and level progression in Firestore.\n- **Match History & Database**: Saves completed matches, game outcomes, and move notations to your profile.\n- **Multiplayer & Matchmaking**: Displays your custom username, avatar, and rating in Worldwide matches and Friend challenges.\n- **Friends & Live Chat**: Enables adding friends, checking online status, and private messaging.\n\n---\n\n### 3. How to Access the Login Page\n- Click the **\"Sign In\"** button in the top right corner of the header, or\n- Select the **\"Account\" / \"Profile\"** option in the navigation bar to sign in or review your stats."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
