  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Create a modular Theme Switcher System for my React + Tailwind CSS Chess Application that supports two custom themes: \"Attack on Titan\" and \"Batman Gotham City\", alongside a \"Classic\" mode.\n\n1. THEME DATA STRUCTURE:\n   - Allow players to select `pieceSet` (\"aot\", \"batman\", \"classic\") and `boardStyle` (\"wall-maria\", \"gotham-city\", \"classic\").\n\n2. BATMAN THEME SPECIFICATIONS:\n   - Dark Squares: #111827 (Night Gotham Asphalt).\n   - Light Squares: #374151 (Wet Steel / Slate).\n   - Board Highlight / Selected Piece: Bat-Signal Neon Yellow glow (rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.5)).\n   - White Pieces (Heroes): Batman (King), Catwoman (Queen), Nightwing/Robin (Bishops), Batmobile (Knights), Wayne Tower (Rooks), GCPD Officers (Pawns).\n   - Black Pieces (Villains): Joker (King), Harley Quinn (Queen), Riddler/Two-Face (Bishops), Bane (Knights), Arkham Asylum (Rooks), Joker Goons (Pawns).\n\n3. ATTACK ON TITAN SPECIFICATIONS:\n   - Dark Squares: #1f232b (Distressed Wall Maria stone).\n   - Light Squares: #5d6f54 (Survey Corps green).\n   - Highlight: ODM Emerald Gas glow (rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.5)).\n   - White Pieces: Erwin/Eren (King), Mikasa (Queen), Levi/Hange (Bishops), Scout Horse (Knights), Wall Maria (Rooks), Scout Recruits (Pawns).\n   - Black Pieces: Colossal Titan (King), Female Titan (Queen), Beast Titan (Bishops), Cart Titan (Knights), Armored Titan (Rooks), Pure Titans (Pawns).\n\n4. CROSSOVER COMPATIBILITY:\n   - Support mixing factions so Player 1 can play as Scout Regiment (AoT) while Player 2 plays as Gotham Villains (Batman)."
    items {
      text: "Create a modular Theme Switcher System for my React + Tailwind CSS Chess Application that supports two custom themes: \"Attack on Titan\" and \"Batman Gotham City\", alongside a \"Classic\" mode.\n\n1. THEME DATA STRUCTURE:\n   - Allow players to select `pieceSet` (\"aot\", \"batman\", \"classic\") and `boardStyle` (\"wall-maria\", \"gotham-city\", \"classic\").\n\n2. BATMAN THEME SPECIFICATIONS:\n   - Dark Squares: #111827 (Night Gotham Asphalt).\n   - Light Squares: #374151 (Wet Steel / Slate).\n   - Board Highlight / Selected Piece: Bat-Signal Neon Yellow glow (rgba(234, 179, 8, 0.5)).\n   - White Pieces (Heroes): Batman (King), Catwoman (Queen), Nightwing/Robin (Bishops), Batmobile (Knights), Wayne Tower (Rooks), GCPD Officers (Pawns).\n   - Black Pieces (Villains): Joker (King), Harley Quinn (Queen), Riddler/Two-Face (Bishops), Bane (Knights), Arkham Asylum (Rooks), Joker Goons (Pawns).\n\n3. ATTACK ON TITAN SPECIFICATIONS:\n   - Dark Squares: #1f232b (Distressed Wall Maria stone).\n   - Light Squares: #5d6f54 (Survey Corps green).\n   - Highlight: ODM Emerald Gas glow (rgba(34, 197, 94, 0.5)).\n   - White Pieces: Erwin/Eren (King), Mikasa (Queen), Levi/Hange (Bishops), Scout Horse (Knights), Wall Maria (Rooks), Scout Recruits (Pawns).\n   - Black Pieces: Colossal Titan (King), Female Titan (Queen), Beast Titan (Bishops), Cart Titan (Knights), Armored Titan (Rooks), Pure Titans (Pawns).\n\n4. CROSSOVER COMPATIBILITY:\n   - Support mixing factions so Player 1 can play as Scout Regiment (AoT) while Player 2 plays as Gotham Villains (Batman)."
    }
  }
}
