  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Act as a Senior Full-Stack Developer and UI/UX Designer.\n\nBuild/Refactor the complete web application layout and theme engine for \"Chesskys (PRO - Peshmerga Edition)\" with the following exact specifications:\n\n---\n### 1. LAYOUT & NAVIGATION (HEADER + COLLAPSIBLE SIDEBAR)\n- **Top Header Bar**:\n  - Compact 56px height (`h-14`) sticky top bar.\n  - Contains ONLY:\n    - Hamburger Toggle Button (`\342\230\260` / `X`) on the far left.\n    - Brand Logo: \"Chesskys\" with a highlighted \"PRO\" badge.\n    - User Profile Avatar on the far right.\n  - REMOVE all main menu links from the top bar to keep it slim.\n\n- **Collapsible Left Sidebar**:\n  - Opened and closed using the Hamburger toggle button (`\342\230\260`).\n  - Mobile backdrop overlay that closes the sidebar when tapping outside.\n  - Contains all navigation links:\n    1. \360\237\244\226 Play AI\n    2. \342\232\224\357\270\217 Multiplayer\n    3. \360\237\247\251 Puzzles & Daily (with a \"DAILY\" highlight badge)\n    4. \360\237\224\215 Analysis\n    5. \360\237\221\244 Profile\n    6. \360\237\214\220 Worldwide\n    7. \360\237\221\245 Friends (Display live online count e.g. \"3 Online\", handling empty/null states cleanly without showing \"null null\").\n    8. \360\237\214\231/\342\230\200\357\270\217 Switch Theme (pinned at the bottom of the sidebar).\n\n---\n### 2. THEME ENGINE & CUSTOM PIECE SETS\nImplement a dynamic Theme Selector supporting 3 themes:\n1. **Attack on Titan (AoT) Theme**:\n   - Board: Wall Maria weathered stone textures (#1f232b dark / #5d6f54 green).\n   - ODM Gas Green glowing highlight on selected moves.\n   - White Pieces (Scout Regiment): Erwin/Eren (King), Mikasa (Queen), Levi/Hange (Bishops), Scout Horse (Knights), Wall Maria Towers (Rooks), Recruits (Pawns).\n   - Black Pieces (Titans): Colossal Titan (King), Female Titan (Queen), Beast Titan (Bishops), Cart Titan (Knights), Armored Titan (Rooks), Pure Titans (Pawns).\n2. **Batman Gotham City Theme**:\n   - Board: Wet Gotham Asphalt & Neon Yellow (#111827 dark / #374151 slate / #eab308 yellow highlight).\n   - White Pieces (Bat-Family): Batman (King), Catwoman (Queen), Nightwing/Robin (Bishops), Batmobile (Knights), Wayne Tower (Rooks), GCPD Officers (Pawns).\n   - Black Pieces (Arkham Rogues): Joker (King), Harley Quinn (Queen), Riddler/Two-Face (Bishops), Bane (Knights), Arkham Asylum (Rooks), Goons (Pawns).\n3. **Classic Theme & Crossover Mode**: Standard chess board option + ability to cross-match factions (e.g., Scouts vs. Arkham Rogues).\n\n---\n### 3. FRIENDS & SOCIAL SYSTEM\n- **Friend Management**:\n  - Add friend by @username search.\n  - Incoming requests drawer with \"Accept\" (\342\234\223) and \"Decline\" (\342\234\225) actions.\n  - Unfriend and Block functionality.\n  - \"Quick Challenge (\342\232\224\357\270\217)\" button next to online friends.\n- **Chat System**:\n  - In-Game Chat drawer with quick-emote presets (\"Good luck!\", \"Nice move!\", \"GG\") and text input + opponent mute toggle.\n  - Direct Messaging (DM) panel for accepted friends outside of games.\n\n---\n### 4. MOBILE UX & RESPONSIVENESS\n- Mobile-first responsive design ensuring the chessboard takes 80%+ of mobile height (`100dvh`).\n- All touch targets minimum 44x44px.\n- Smooth CSS transitions for the collapsible sidebar drawer (`transition-transform duration-300`)."
    items {
      text: "Act as a Senior Full-Stack Developer and UI/UX Designer.\n\nBuild/Refactor the complete web application layout and theme engine for \"Chesskys (PRO - Peshmerga Edition)\" with the following exact specifications:\n\n---\n### 1. LAYOUT & NAVIGATION (HEADER + COLLAPSIBLE SIDEBAR)\n- **Top Header Bar**:\n  - Compact 56px height (`h-14`) sticky top bar.\n  - Contains ONLY:\n    - Hamburger Toggle Button (`\342\230\260` / `X`) on the far left.\n    - Brand Logo: \"Chesskys\" with a highlighted \"PRO\" badge.\n    - User Profile Avatar on the far right.\n  - REMOVE all main menu links from the top bar to keep it slim.\n\n- **Collapsible Left Sidebar**:\n  - Opened and closed using the Hamburger toggle button (`\342\230\260`).\n  - Mobile backdrop overlay that closes the sidebar when tapping outside.\n  - Contains all navigation links:\n    1. \360\237\244\226 Play AI\n    2. \342\232\224\357\270\217 Multiplayer\n    3. \360\237\247\251 Puzzles & Daily (with a \"DAILY\" highlight badge)\n    4. \360\237\224\215 Analysis\n    5. \360\237\221\244 Profile\n    6. \360\237\214\220 Worldwide\n    7. \360\237\221\245 Friends (Display live online count e.g. \"3 Online\", handling empty/null states cleanly without showing \"null null\").\n    8. \360\237\214\231/\342\230\200\357\270\217 Switch Theme (pinned at the bottom of the sidebar).\n\n---\n### 2. THEME ENGINE & CUSTOM PIECE SETS\nImplement a dynamic Theme Selector supporting 3 themes:\n1. **Attack on Titan (AoT) Theme**:\n   - Board: Wall Maria weathered stone textures (#1f232b dark / #5d6f54 green).\n   - ODM Gas Green glowing highlight on selected moves.\n   - White Pieces (Scout Regiment): Erwin/Eren (King), Mikasa (Queen), Levi/Hange (Bishops), Scout Horse (Knights), Wall Maria Towers (Rooks), Recruits (Pawns).\n   - Black Pieces (Titans): Colossal Titan (King), Female Titan (Queen), Beast Titan (Bishops), Cart Titan (Knights), Armored Titan (Rooks), Pure Titans (Pawns).\n2. **Batman Gotham City Theme**:\n   - Board: Wet Gotham Asphalt & Neon Yellow (#111827 dark / #374151 slate / #eab308 yellow highlight).\n   - White Pieces (Bat-Family): Batman (King), Catwoman (Queen), Nightwing/Robin (Bishops), Batmobile (Knights), Wayne Tower (Rooks), GCPD Officers (Pawns).\n   - Black Pieces (Arkham Rogues): Joker (King), Harley Quinn (Queen), Riddler/Two-Face (Bishops), Bane (Knights), Arkham Asylum (Rooks), Goons (Pawns).\n3. **Classic Theme & Crossover Mode**: Standard chess board option + ability to cross-match factions (e.g., Scouts vs. Arkham Rogues).\n\n---\n### 3. FRIENDS & SOCIAL SYSTEM\n- **Friend Management**:\n  - Add friend by @username search.\n  - Incoming requests drawer with \"Accept\" (\342\234\223) and \"Decline\" (\342\234\225) actions.\n  - Unfriend and Block functionality.\n  - \"Quick Challenge (\342\232\224\357\270\217)\" button next to online friends.\n- **Chat System**:\n  - In-Game Chat drawer with quick-emote presets (\"Good luck!\", \"Nice move!\", \"GG\") and text input + opponent mute toggle.\n  - Direct Messaging (DM) panel for accepted friends outside of games.\n\n---\n### 4. MOBILE UX & RESPONSIVENESS\n- Mobile-first responsive design ensuring the chessboard takes 80%+ of mobile height (`100dvh`).\n- All touch targets minimum 44x44px.\n- Smooth CSS transitions for the collapsible sidebar drawer (`transition-transform duration-300`)."
    }
  }
}
