  planner_response {
    thinking: "**Designing In-Game Chat**\n\nI\'m currently fleshing out the design for in-game chat. I\'m leaning towards a dedicated `InGameChatDrawer.tsx` component or integrating it directly into `OnlineMatchView.tsx`. The initial plan includes quick-emote presets and real-time message bubbles. I also want to incorporate an opponent mute toggle for a better user experience.\n\n\n**Expanding Chat Functionality**\n\nI\'ve added a text input box for custom messages. Now, I\'m focusing on the layout and navigation. I\'m designing a top header bar with a hamburger toggle, logo, and user profile avatar. This is intended to stay compact. The collapsible sidebar, opened by the hamburger, will contain all the primary navigation links with an online count for the Friends tab. Lastly, a theme engine to support 3 core themes, including an Attack on Titan theme, is being added.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
      seconds: 1
      nanos: 418842058
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
