    thinking: "**Constructing Theme Modal**\n\nI\'m now focused on building the `ThemeSelectorModal` component. My priority is integrating the dynamic themes, starting with the \"Attack on Titan\" preset. I\'m aiming for a weathered stone texture for the board, replicating the Wall Maria aesthetic.\n\n\n**Developing Theme Implementations**\n\nI\'ve moved on from the base modal structure and am now fleshing out the individual theme implementations. The AoT and Batman Gotham City themes are taking shape, complete with piece assignments and color palettes. I\'m focusing on making each theme visually distinct, and am excited to create the Gotham asphalt texture. Also, I\'m setting up a \"Classic\" option for standard play and a \"Crossover Mode\" for mixed factions.\n\n\n"
    thinking_duration {
