  planner_response {
    response: "I have completed the layout refactoring, responsive navigation, and theme engine for **Chesskys (PRO - Peshmerga Edition)**:\n\n- **Layout & Navigation (Header + Collapsible Sidebar)**:\n  - **Compact Sticky Top Bar (`h-14`)**: Refactored the top header to a 56px bar housing the Hamburger toggle button (`\342\230\260`), the \"Chesskys\" brand logo with a highlighted \"PRO\" badge, and the user profile avatar with real-time Elo rating.\n  - **Collapsible Left Sidebar Drawer**: Created a collapsible navigation drawer featuring smooth CSS transitions (`transition-transform duration-300`) and a backdrop overlay for mobile dismissal. Houses all navigation items (*Play AI*, *Multiplayer*, *Puzzles & Daily* with a \"DAILY\" badge, *Analysis*, *Profile*, *Worldwide Match*, *Friends*, and pinned *Theme Engine* controls).\n  - **Robust Friends Counter**: Sanitized presence formatting to eliminate empty-state text defects, displaying live counters (e.g., `3 Online` or `0 Online`) cleanly.\n\n- **Theme Engine & Custom Faction Pieces**:\n  - **Attack on Titan (AoT)**: Wall Maria weathered stone board (`#1f232b` / `#5d6f54`) with glowing ODM Gas Green move highlights, Scout Regiment pieces (White) versus the Nine Titans (Black).\n  - **Batman Gotham City**: Wet Gotham Asphalt board (`#111827` / `#374151`) with Bat-Signal Neon Yellow glowing highlights, Bat-Family heroes (White) versus Arkham Rogues villains (Black).\n  - **Classic & Crossover Mode**: Standalone Staunton tournament pieces and an interactive Crossover switcher allowing players to pit any custom white faction against any custom black faction.\n\n- **Friends & Social System**:\n  - **Friend Management**: @Username directory search, incoming/outgoing request management with accept/decline actions, unfriending, and quick \342\232\224\357\270\217 challenge buttons.\n  - **In-Game Match Chat Drawer**: Integrated match-side drawer with 8 tactical quick-emote reactions (\"Good luck!\", \"Nice move!\", \"GG!\", etc.), text input, and an opponent mute toggle."
    thinking: "**Verifying User Requirements**\n\nI\'ve got confirmation on the applet\'s error-free compilation! Now, I\'m diving into the user requirements to meticulously verify each aspect. I\'m starting with the layout and navigation, focusing on the header and collapsible sidebar details. Specifically, the top header bar, its sticky properties, and dimensions. I\'ll meticulously check the components to make sure they\'re as the user wants them to be.\n\n\n"
    modified_response: "I have completed the layout refactoring, responsive navigation, and theme engine for **Chesskys (PRO - Peshmerga Edition)**:\n\n- **Layout & Navigation (Header + Collapsible Sidebar)**:\n  - **Compact Sticky Top Bar (`h-14`)**: Refactored the top header to a 56px bar housing the Hamburger toggle button (`\342\230\260`), the \"Chesskys\" brand logo with a highlighted \"PRO\" badge, and the user profile avatar with real-time Elo rating.\n  - **Collapsible Left Sidebar Drawer**: Created a collapsible navigation drawer featuring smooth CSS transitions (`transition-transform duration-300`) and a backdrop overlay for mobile dismissal. Houses all navigation items (*Play AI*, *Multiplayer*, *Puzzles & Daily* with a \"DAILY\" badge, *Analysis*, *Profile*, *Worldwide Match*, *Friends*, and pinned *Theme Engine* controls).\n  - **Robust Friends Counter**: Sanitized presence formatting to eliminate empty-state text defects, displaying live counters (e.g., `3 Online` or `0 Online`) cleanly.\n\n- **Theme Engine & Custom Faction Pieces**:\n  - **Attack on Titan (AoT)**: Wall Maria weathered stone board (`#1f232b` / `#5d6f54`) with glowing ODM Gas Green move highlights, Scout Regiment pieces (White) versus the Nine Titans (Black).\n  - **Batman Gotham City**: Wet Gotham Asphalt board (`#111827` / `#374151`) with Bat-Signal Neon Yellow glowing highlights, Bat-Family heroes (White) versus Arkham Rogues villains (Black).\n  - **Classic & Crossover Mode**: Standalone Staunton tournament pieces and an interactive Crossover switcher allowing players to pit any custom white faction against any custom black faction.\n\n- **Friends & Social System**:\n  - **Friend Management**: @Username directory search, incoming/outgoing request management with accept/decline actions, unfriending, and quick \342\232\224\357\270\217 challenge buttons.\n  - **In-Game Match Chat Drawer**: Integrated match-side drawer with 8 tactical quick-emote reactions (\"Good luck!\", \"Nice move!\", \"GG!\", etc.), text input, and an opponent mute toggle."
    thinking_duration {
      nanos: 266279621
    }
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
}
