  planner_response {
    response: "I have redesigned and refined The Joker and the Arkham villains piece set:\n\n- **The Joker (King)**:\n  - **Royal Chess King Silhouette**: Restructured the piece with a regal King base and posture, replacing the deformed lines with sharp vector geometry and high-contrast styling.\n  - **Signature Outfit**: Styled with a tailored Arkham purple tuxedo jacket, emerald silk waistcoat, golden bowtie, and an acid flower corsage on the lapel.\n  - **Iconic Features**: Replaced the floating dots with a pale face silhouette, toxic emerald slicked-back hair with spiked crown tufts, arched dark eye shadow, and the legendary razor-sharp crimson grin with pearly white teeth.\n  - **King Finial**: Topped with a twisted golden King\'s cross finial and red gem accent.\n\n- **Harmonized Arkham Villains Army**:\n  - **Harley Quinn (Queen)**: Balanced red-and-black jester bodice with pointed bells, crisp white harlequin collar, and diamond skirt motifs.\n  - **The Riddler (Bishop)**: Crisp bowler hat with green mitre curve and vibrant `?` sigil.\n  - **Bane (Knight)**: Armored steed silhouette with glowing venom canister tubes and tactical respiratory mask.\n  - **Arkham Asylum (Rook)**: Gothic fortress castle with wrought-iron gate bars and illuminated red monograms.\n  - **Playing-Card Goon (Pawn)**: Tailcoat pawn base with green jester skull cap and classic minion grin."
    modified_response: "I have redesigned and refined The Joker and the Arkham villains piece set:\n\n- **The Joker (King)**:\n  - **Royal Chess King Silhouette**: Restructured the piece with a regal King base and posture, replacing the deformed lines with sharp vector geometry and high-contrast styling.\n  - **Signature Outfit**: Styled with a tailored Arkham purple tuxedo jacket, emerald silk waistcoat, golden bowtie, and an acid flower corsage on the lapel.\n  - **Iconic Features**: Replaced the floating dots with a pale face silhouette, toxic emerald slicked-back hair with spiked crown tufts, arched dark eye shadow, and the legendary razor-sharp crimson grin with pearly white teeth.\n  - **King Finial**: Topped with a twisted golden King\'s cross finial and red gem accent.\n\n- **Harmonized Arkham Villains Army**:\n  - **Harley Quinn (Queen)**: Balanced red-and-black jester bodice with pointed bells, crisp white harlequin collar, and diamond skirt motifs.\n  - **The Riddler (Bishop)**: Crisp bowler hat with green mitre curve and vibrant `?` sigil.\n  - **Bane (Knight)**: Armored steed silhouette with glowing venom canister tubes and tactical respiratory mask.\n  - **Arkham Asylum (Rook)**: Gothic fortress castle with wrought-iron gate bars and illuminated red monograms.\n  - **Playing-Card Goon (Pawn)**: Tailcoat pawn base with green jester skull cap and classic minion grin."
    stop_reason: STOP_REASON_STOP_PATTERN
  }
