steps {
  type: CORTEX_STEP_TYPE_USER_INPUT
  status: CORTEX_STEP_STATUS_DONE
  metadata {
    created_at {
      seconds: 1788110583
      nanos: 979805907
    }
    source: CORTEX_STEP_SOURCE_USER_EXPLICIT
  }
  user_input {
    user_response: "Act as a Senior Full-Stack Developer, UI/UX Designer, and Cybersecurity Specialist.\n\nBuild/Refactor the \"Chesskys (PRO - Peshmerga Edition)\" application with ultra-smooth UI animations, a refined dark color palette, and robust security protections:\n\n---\n### 1. UI SMOOTHNESS & ANIMATIONS\n- Use Framer Motion for smooth spring animations (`type: \"spring\", stiffness: 350, damping: 25`) on:\n  - Piece moves and capture animations.\n  - Collapsible sidebar drawer sliding (`translate-x`).\n  - Modal popups and notification toasts.\n- Apply `will-change: transform` and `aspect-square` on the chessboard container to ensure 60fps rendering and zero Layout Shift (CLS).\n\n---\n### 2. REFINED COLOR PALETTE & DESIGN SYSTEM\n- Surface Base: `#0B0F19` (Deep Obsidian Blue).\n- Panel Surfaces: `#111827` (Slate Dark) with `#1F293D` subtle borders.\n- Accent: `#F59E0B` (Amber Gold), `#10B981` (Win Green), `#EF4444` (Loss Red).\n- Board Themes:\n  - AoT: `#1C221A` (Stone) & `#4A5D43` (Scout Green).\n  - Batman: `#0D1117` (Gotham Dark) & `#FACC15` (Neon Gold highlight).\n\n---\n### 3. LAYOUT & SIDEBAR NAVIGATION\n- Top Header: Compact 56px (`h-14`) sticky top bar with Hamburger Toggle (`\342\230\260`), Logo (\"Chesskys PRO\"), and Profile Avatar.\n- Collapsible Sidebar: Left drawer containing Play AI, Multiplayer, Puzzles & Daily, Analysis, Profile, Worldwide, Friends (with live count badge), and Theme Switcher.\n\n---\n### 4. SECURITY & ANTI-CHEAT IMPLEMENTATION\n- Server-Side Validation: Validate every chess move on the backend using `chess.js` before broadcasting to opponents.\n- XSS Prevention: Sanitize all in-game and DM chat input using `DOMPurify`.\n- Secure Auth: Store authentication tokens strictly in `HttpOnly`, `Secure`, `SameSite=Strict` cookies.\n- Rate Limiting: Apply rate limits on API endpoints for friend requests, authentication, and chat messages."
    items {
      text: "Act as a Senior Full-Stack Developer, UI/UX Designer, and Cybersecurity Specialist.\n\nBuild/Refactor the \"Chesskys (PRO - Peshmerga Edition)\" application with ultra-smooth UI animations, a refined dark color palette, and robust security protections:\n\n---\n### 1. UI SMOOTHNESS & ANIMATIONS\n- Use Framer Motion for smooth spring animations (`type: \"spring\", stiffness: 350, damping: 25`) on:\n  - Piece moves and capture animations.\n  - Collapsible sidebar drawer sliding (`translate-x`).\n  - Modal popups and notification toasts.\n- Apply `will-change: transform` and `aspect-square` on the chessboard container to ensure 60fps rendering and zero Layout Shift (CLS).\n\n---\n### 2. REFINED COLOR PALETTE & DESIGN SYSTEM\n- Surface Base: `#0B0F19` (Deep Obsidian Blue).\n- Panel Surfaces: `#111827` (Slate Dark) with `#1F293D` subtle borders.\n- Accent: `#F59E0B` (Amber Gold), `#10B981` (Win Green), `#EF4444` (Loss Red).\n- Board Themes:\n  - AoT: `#1C221A` (Stone) & `#4A5D43` (Scout Green).\n  - Batman: `#0D1117` (Gotham Dark) & `#FACC15` (Neon Gold highlight).\n\n---\n### 3. LAYOUT & SIDEBAR NAVIGATION\n- Top Header: Compact 56px (`h-14`) sticky top bar with Hamburger Toggle (`\342\230\260`), Logo (\"Chesskys PRO\"), and Profile Avatar.\n- Collapsible Sidebar: Left drawer containing Play AI, Multiplayer, Puzzles & Daily, Analysis, Profile, Worldwide, Friends (with live count badge), and Theme Switcher.\n\n---\n### 4. SECURITY & ANTI-CHEAT IMPLEMENTATION\n- Server-Side Validation: Validate every chess move on the backend using `chess.js` before broadcasting to opponents.\n- XSS Prevention: Sanitize all in-game and DM chat input using `DOMPurify`.\n- Secure Auth: Store authentication tokens strictly in `HttpOnly`, `Secure`, `SameSite=Strict` cookies.\n- Rate Limiting: Apply rate limits on API endpoints for friend requests, authentication, and chat messages."
    }
  }
}
